      ...close([['I can say the days of the week.', 'Sunday, Monday, Tuesday …'], ['I can say how often.', 'I play soccer twice a week.'], ['I can answer "When do you …?"', 'I watch TV on Saturdays and Sundays.']], { img: G('cover008'), q: 'How many times a week do you go to school?', ko: '학교에 일주일에 몇 번 가요? (008에서 만나요)' }),
